Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Avengers:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Endgame reportedly cost 356 million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What did it need back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Avengers:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Doomsday hits theatres this December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Every record will trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Records are not profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Most fans think ticket money goes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It made the film,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Theatres keep roughly half of every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In China,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,foreign studios reportedly get only a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that budget only made the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Marketing reportedly cost about the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Analysts' rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,a big film must earn 2.5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,times its budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,just to break even.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Endgame crossed that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,reportedly making Disney a huge profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For Doomsday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,ask one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,how many times its budget?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to the friend who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,thinks box office means profit.
